rier-matched add-back."}],"source_module_dispositions":[{"source_module":"Polished peel aperture","disposition":"REBASE","rationale":"Becomes restrained bergamot light around a juniper capsule."},{"source_module":"Wet-cut ginger cortex","disposition":"KEEP","rationale":"Wet ginger splits berry/coniferous lift and preserves the collection gesture."},{"source_module":"Warm rhizome heart","disposition":"REBASE","rationale":"Warm ginger becomes a thin inner seam rather than a spice heart."},{"source_module":"Violet tailored cloth","disposition":"KEEP","rationale":"Violet cloth prevents aromatic-fougère takeover."},{"source_module":"Green-metallic incision field","disposition":"REBASE","rationale":"Basil, Parmavert, and Scentenal provide a controlled cool incision."},{"source_module":"Air and negative space","disposition":"KEEP","rationale":"Floral/mineral air separates berry capsule, cloth, and wood grain."},{"source_module":"Literal cedar-vetiver grain","disposition":"KEEP","rationale":"Promoted into differentiated cedar strata and a root-dry residue."},{"source_module":"Natural tonka-sandal yielding chamber","disposition":"REBASE","rationale":"Sweet tonka is removed; restrained sandal gives a yielding dry interior."},{"source_module":"Slow transition and recurrence matrix","disposition":"KEEP","rationale":"Juniper returns through terpinyl, cedar, green wood, salicylate, and root dryness."},{"source_module":"Sole Romandolide aura","disposition":"REJECT WITH ISOLATED TEST/RATIONALE","rationale":"Primary hypothesis is musk-free so dry grain remains exposed."}],"target_modules":["cool berry capsule","wet ginger incision","bergamot light rim","basil-green seam","violet tailored cloth","mineral negative space","three-grain cedar field","root-dry residue","yielding dry sandal interior","musk-free juniper recurrence"]}
