## Claim ceiling

Computational formulation hypothesis only. Smell, liking, target fidelity, hedonism, complexity, depth, luxury, transitions, recurrence, safety, stability, skin performance, sillage, longevity, and release are **NOT TESTED / HOLD**. No procurement, no compounding, no wear, no release, and no integration-readiness claim.
